<p>Hits the target on the arms with one rotating saw doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">126%, 137%, 146%, 153%, 160%</acronym> damage and trying to maim it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 3</acronym> turns.</p><p>Maimed foes deal <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 25%, 31%, 34%, 37%</acronym> less damage.</p><p>The chance improves with your Physical power.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Cutting your foes has never been so simple!</span></span></p>